OL,3,AGovernment failures allowed Covid to
OL,4,A'spread like wildfire' in care homes,
OL,5,Ainquiry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FBaroness Hallett says the Covid
OL,8,Fpandemic "totally disrupted" the lives
OL,9,Fof people in care homes and had a
OL,10,F"devastating impact" - there were more
OL,11,Fthan 43,000 deaths involving Covid in
OL,12,Fcare homes between March 2020 and July
OL,13,F2022
OL,15,FHer latest report, on the UK's adult
OL,16,Fsocial care sector, says patients were
OL,17,Fmoved to care homes from hospitals with
OL,18,Fno early guidance to isolate arrivals -
OL,19,Fread key findings from the inquiry
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
