OL,3,AGovernment failures allowed Covid to
OL,4,A'spread like wildfire' in care homes,
OL,5,Ainquiry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FCare workers had to resort to desperate
OL,8,Fmeasures to get PPE, with some using
OL,9,Ffestival waterproof ponchos, painters'
OL,10,Foveralls and bin bags
OL,12,FThe government at the time knew the
OL,13,Fcare sector was "extremely vulnerable"
OL,14,Fbut still failed to act until it was
OL,15,Ftoo late, families say
OL,17,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has pledged
OL,18,Fto use the findings to develop an
OL,19,F"action plan" in case of a future
OL,20,Fpandemic
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
